{"body":{"text":["The session built it. A paragraph, an item, a lifted sentence and a link hold their text as runs, a new shape inline admitting a string or a holon; the writer keeps marks in the text and makes a holon only of a link into the field; the page reads a paragraph's runs as one marked text, a holon standing in it, so a mark may reach across one; rewrite.ts lifts again a sentence whose text still stands, and thread.ts lifts the sentences a thread is raised in. glass's text, measure and lexicon were written anew in the language, the engine refusing a sort given one argument until it was corrected."]},"id":"1M82PZ6MG0VA000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The stores were folded through the engine, glass's types first taking both forms, then paper, wiki and author, then glass's types final with word, emphasis, strong and codespan let go: some 230,000 words and the holons of marks let go, the 95 sentences threads and measures point at lifted with their ids, the field from about 252,000 holons to 7,068. Knowledge read as text the same, byte for byte, 105,550 characters, in about 0.36 s at the command line where it took 0.8 s, a quarter of a second as a blank reader timed it after; on the site Knowledge opened in 60 ms where it took 90, The design in 170 where 222, Programs in 207 where 288; 258 tests pass. The measure of Knowledge moved from 34,480 to 35,405 and the lexicon from 7,141 to 7,625, marks and code now counted within text."]},"id":"1M82PZ6MG0VA001","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["It kept the session from its exported transcript, its answers mended where a blank reader found them short; gave Knowledge prose held as text and why words had been holons, mended after two blank readers found measurements cited to the wrong utterance, the grain claimed as the author's, and what he allowed for now and his reasons lost; then committed and pushed."]},"id":"1M82PZ6MG0VA002","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
